        "nameWithOwner": "restatedev/restate"
      },
      "comments": {
        "nodes": [
          {
            "url": "https://github.com/restatedev/restate/pull/5518#issuecomment-6059209103",
            "author": {
              "login": "github-actions"
            },
            "body": "## Test Results\n\u2007\u20078 files\u2004 \u00b10\u2002\u2003\u2007\u20078 suites\u2004 \u00b10\u2002\u2003\u20025m 26s \u23f1\ufe0f +9s\n\u200761 tests \u00b10\u2002\u2003\u200761 \u2705 \u00b10\u2002\u20030 \ud83d\udca4 \u00b10\u2002\u20030 \u274c \u00b10\u2002\n268 runs\u200a \u00b10\u2002\u2003268 \u2705 \u00b10\u2002\u20030 \ud83d\udca4 \u00b10\u2002\u20030 \u274c \u00b10\u2002\n\nResults for commit 83b642c2.\u2003\u00b1 Comparison against base commit 06f96af8.\n\n[test-results]:data:application/gzip;base64,H4sIAPOFx2oC/12MSw6CMBQAr0K6dtEWfFYvY15/yYtATT8r490tBLC6nJlkXszT6BK7derUsVQoH2BLxExhrthLqKKmvEQQO9xTMebPPOhZDT+ERxp/hIsxxM3EMi9HCWqD/dia73HlZrhy+zNhmihXYKrXMEgjUVzxbD0H0IPQXuLFKnAgtAOOzvbs/QFcm55XAwEAAA==\n\n:recycle: This comment has been updated with latest results."
          },
          {
            "url": "https://github.com/restatedev/restate/pull/5518#issuecomment-6106900252",
            "author": {
              "login": "kvnloo"
            },
            "body": "One bounded source-level gap worth checking on pcholakov's current head `83b642c2a19a5df066b41bf2a7d86e61be60aed3`: `report_partition_snapshot_gauges()` skips a led partition when it has no entry in `latest_snapshots`. After a worker restart, that map can be empty; when automatic snapshots are disabled, I could not identify a guaranteed status-refresh path that populates it before metrics reporting. The new per-partition age/LSN-lag series may therefore remain absent for a leader, despite the PR's intended behavior that gauges update with automatic snapshots disabled.\n\nThis is a **source-level P2 observation only**, not a native Rust regression or real metrics-recorder run. The new freshness calculations and stale-leader logic are not being challenged. A focused restart-with-automatic-snapshots-off metrics-recorder case would determine whether the gap is observable. Credit to pcholakov for the implementation; the independent review came from dot."
          }
        ],
        "pageInfo": {
          "hasNextPage": false
        }
      },
